.TH tclutils n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Collection"
.SH NAME
tclutils \- portable Unix-like utilities in pure Tcl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
package require tclutils ?0.16.0?
package require tclutils::tufind ?0.1?
package require tclutils::tugrep ?0.1?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
tclutils is a Tcllib\-style collection of portable utilities. Package names use the tu prefix to avoid collisions with Unix command names and other Tcl packages.
.PP
Add the module path and require individual packages or the umbrella package:
.PP
.nf
tcl::tm::path add /path/to/tclutils/lib/tm
package require tclutils
.fi
.SH MODULES
.PP
See the individual manual pages in section n, for example tugrep(n), tudiff(n), tubin(n).
.PP
Command-line wrappers for a subset of modules are documented in section 1, for example tufind(1) and tugrep(1).
.SH LICENSE
.PP
MIT License. Independent implementation; no GNU coreutils source or manual text is included.

